==English==
{{wikipedia|Halle (Saale)}}

===Etymology===
* As a {{der|en|de|-}} surname, variant of {{m|en|Hall}}.
* As a {{der|en|fr|-}} surname, from the noun {{m|fr|halle|t=covered room}}.
* As a Belgian and {{der|en|nl|-}} surname, from {{w|Halle, Belgium}}.
* As a Jewish surname, from [[w:Halle (Saale)|Halle]] in Saxony, named after the river {{m|en|Saale}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{q|female given name}} {{enPR|hălē}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈhæli/}}

