===Etymology 2===
Attested in early manuscripts as ''Halla''. Of unclear origin, traditionally linked to the river {{m|en|Saale}}, whose name ultimately derives from {{der|de|ine-pro|*séh₂ls|t=salt}}. Or, from {{der|de|gmw-pro|*hallju|t=building supported by columns}}.

